Z||000024||rogergarrison||11-02-2001||07:27 PM||||Oklahoma & Texas are good for getting turtles, armadillos, and big tarantulas. At nite the tarantulas swarm on the warm hiway and can jump a couple of feet. I found that out driving home with my arm resting on the door, window open. felt something and looked over to see like 3 or 4 inch one sitting on my arm. scared the **** outta me.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> just noticed I busted 3,000 posts !!!!!<P>DO I WIN ANYTHING??????  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 11-02-2001).]||||reg||1
